                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "After working as a cashier for a couple of years, I quit and promised myself to never, EVER, go through the horror of dealing with annoying customers again. I did miss the satisfying beeps products being scanned... so I paid money to do my old job without actually getting paid for it. At least now I can swear at those moody turds without the fear of getting fired.",
